## Third-party attribution

This project contains code adapted from, and depends on, the following projects.

### deepseek-recipe (MIT)

- The HTTP/SSE response structure in `deepinfer_bridge/server.py` and the request
  preparation flow in `deepinfer_bridge/protocol.py` follow the `server-py` example from
  <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-recipe> (MIT).
- The `deepseek-recipe` package itself is a runtime dependency
  (`deepseek-recipe>=0.2,<0.3`), used for request conversion, prompt encoding, streaming
  decode, tool-call/thinking parsing and usage accounting.

### DeepInfer (Apache License 2.0)

- `deepinfer_bridge/engine_real.py` mirrors the engine construction and environment setup of
  DeepInfer's `examples/_config.py`, `examples/_launch.py` and
  `examples/offline_inference.py`:
  <https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer> (Apache-2.0).
- DeepInfer is not vendored here; it is imported at runtime on supported hardware.
